ytokine production (expressed as % of baseline value), the resulting fold increase in the interferon (IFN)-&#x003b3;/interleukin (IL)-5 ratio, and subject characteristics.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="kjim-23-176-i003"/><table-wrap-foot><fn><p>BRindex, bronchial responsiveness index; Atopy score, sum of all grades for skin test reactivity in response to 10 common aeroallergens; House dust mite score, sum of grades for <italic>Dermatophagoides farinae</italic> and <italic>D. pteronyssinus</italic> reactivity; DHEAS, dehydroepiandrosterone sulfate. <sup>*</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.05 and <sup>**</sup><italic>p</italic>&#x0003c;0.01.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>